    "Later successful request returns the same object reference and does not inherit a refusal. A throwing content getter is not inspected.",
    "Malformed non-member host code keeps the existing return result but is not exported by the new repository marker.",
    "Existing owner, workspace, revoked credential, queue deduplication and cloud startup regression tests pass."
  ],
  "limitations": [
